<div class=\"space-y-6\"><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Cinebench R23</p><div class=\"flex gap-3 flex-wrap\"><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Multi core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">16,292</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">84<!-- -->w</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">cpu_ratio</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">903</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Single core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">1,801</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">84<!-- -->w</p></div></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Cinebench R24</p><div class=\"flex gap-3 flex-wrap\"><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Multi core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">981</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">84<!-- -->w</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">cpu_ratio</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">882</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Single core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">111</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">84<!-- -->w</p></div></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Unigine Heaven</p><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\"><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\">Res</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Score</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">FPS</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">720p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">4,273</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">169.6</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">40w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1080p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">2,158</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">85.7</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">40w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1440p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">1,254</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">49.8</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">40w</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Furmark</p><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\"><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\">Res</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Score</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">FPS</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">720p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">3,009</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">50.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">34w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1080p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">1,994</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">33.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">34w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1440p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">1,341</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">22.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">34w</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-4\">Builder notes</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-ink leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line\">Compact 7.10L build pairing Ryzen 7 8700G APU with ADLink Intel ARC A380E GPU for professional productivity and video transcoding work. The A380E is a true single-slot design requiring no external PCIe power, making it ideal for small form factor systems. Case supports full-size mATX motherboards and CPUs up to 69mm high, with low-profile single-slot GPU requirement. Ryzen 8700G provides strong integrated Radeon 870M graphics while the A380E GPU handles professional AV1 encoding tasks. Testing revealed AV1 10-bit (Intel QSV) encoding of a 9-minute 1080p h264 video completed in 46 seconds versus 10 minutes 2 seconds with SVT preset 5. The A380E performs weakly for AAA gaming but excels at video transcoding and AV1 encoding. Case includes leather handle, supports Flex-ATX PSUs, and can accommodate optional thin case fans via modification. Future testing planned with Intel CPU to fully leverage ARC A380E capabilities. Well-suited for content creation and professional workflows rather than gaming.</p></section></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5 space-y-4\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink\">Performance</h2><div><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\">CPU — CB23 Multi</p><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">16,292</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\"><div class=\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-accent\" style=\"width:52%\"></div></div><span class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-12 text-right\">top <!-- -->48<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 text-xs text-ink-muted mt-2\"><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">194</span> pts/w</span><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">19<!-- -->°C</span> headroom</span></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\">GPU — Heaven 1080p</p><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">85.7<!-- --> <span class=\"text-base font-normal text-ink-muted\">fps</span></p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\"><div class=\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-sff-amber\" style=\"width:29%\"></div></div><span class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-12 text-right\">top <!-- -->71<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 text-xs text-ink-muted mt-2\"><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">2.14</span> fps/w</span><span><span class=\"font-medium text-sff-red\">-3<!-- -->°C</span> headroom</span></div></div></section></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"border-t border-line bg-surface mt-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-12 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start justify-between gap-8\"><div><p class=\"font-semibold text-ink mb-1\">ComponentWatch</p><p class=\"text-sm text-ink-muted max-w-xs\">Community-verified benchmarks and real-world data for small-form-factor PC builders.</p></div><div class=\"flex gap-12 text-sm\"><div class=\"space-y-2\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Explore</p><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\" href=\"/builds\">Builds</a><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\" href=\"/cases\">Cases</a><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\" href=\"/compare\">Compare</a><a class=\"block text